1. FRACTAL MANIFOLD API

The geometry engine.

1.1 GET /manifold/state

Returns the current fractal manifold state.

Response:

{
  "depth": D_n,
  "resonance_points": [R_1, R_2, ...],
  "potential_gradient": "∇D",
  "integrity": "QED_LOCKED"
}

1.2 POST /manifold/iterate

Executes one fractal recursion step.

Body:

{
  "resonance_input": R_n,
  "interaction_function": "f(R_n)"
}

Response:

{
  "new_depth": D_n+1,
  "new_resonance_points": [...],
  "status": "MANIFOLD_UPDATED"
}

1.3 POST /manifold/set-boundary

Sets manifold boundary conditions.

Body:

{
  "boundary_type": "hyper-spatial",
  "constraints": {...}
}

2. QUANTUM ENTANGLEMENT API

The correlation engine.

2.1 GET /quantum/nodes

Returns all quantum nodes and their states.

Response:

{
  "nodes": [
    {"id": "ψ1", "state_vector": [...]},
    {"id": "ψ2", "state_vector": [...]}
  ]
}

2.2 GET /quantum/correlation

Returns correlation tensor (C_{ij}).

Response:

{
  "tensor": [[...],[...]],
  "decoherence": δ,
  "stability_ratio": Q_ℓ
}

2.3 POST /quantum/stabilize

Stabilizes entanglement lattice.

Body:

{
  "target_stability": 0.98
}

3. NEURAL LATTICE API

The adaptive refinement engine.

3.1 GET /lattice/state

Returns lattice size, latency, and activation distribution.

Response:

{
  "size": N,
  "latency": "α log(N)",
  "activation_probability": P_a,
  "clusters": [...]
}

3.2 POST /lattice/grow

Expands the lattice.

Body:

{
  "growth_factor": β,
  "thermodynamic_feedback": α
}

3.3 POST /lattice/refine

Triggers cluster refinement.

Body:

{
  "refinement_mode": "thermodynamic",
  "iterations": 1
}

4. LEDGER PROVENANCE API

The integrity engine.

4.1 GET /ledger/chain

Returns the full hash chain.

Response:

{
  "chain": [
    {"block": 0, "hash": H_0, "snapshot": S_0},
    {"block": 1, "hash": H_1, "snapshot": S_1}
  ],
  "integrity_ratio": I
}

4.2 POST /ledger/commit

Commits a new state snapshot.

Body:

{
  "snapshot": S_n+1
}

Response:

{
  "block": n+1,
  "hash": H_n+1,
  "status": "COMMIT_SUCCESS"
}

4.3 POST /ledger/consensus

Runs P2P consensus.

Body:

{
  "peers": ["nodeA", "nodeB", "nodeC"]
}

5. PHASE‑LOCK ENGINE API

The unified loop controller.

5.1 POST /phase-lock/start

Starts the full 4‑layer loop.

Body:

{
  "mode": "continuous",
  "iterations": 1
}

5.2 GET /phase-lock/status

Returns current loop state.

Response:

{
  "geometry": {...},
  "quantum": {...},
  "neural": {...},
  "ledger": {...},
  "loop_state": "ACTIVE"
}

5.3 POST /phase-lock/stop

Stops the loop.

